a2.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/120/en/120c1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/120/en/120b1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n\n</details>","markdown_ja":"なんとっ！！\n\nいま！スタッフに誕生日を祝ってもらいました！！\n\n明日誕生日なんです！！\n\nチョコレートケーキとスタバのトールラテ！！\n\n超美味しかったー！！\n\n感謝感激！！\n\nありがとう！！\n\n<img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/120/ja/120a1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/120/ja/120c1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-director/archive/120/ja/120b1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">"}}